Date:   Mon Feb 20 15:47:29 2017 +0100

    Improvement: The auto-renaming of newly created files/folders now happens onCreation instead of in multiple places. This solves multiple cases where creating files caused problems.

diff --git a/structr-ui/src/main/java/org/structr/web/entity/AbstractFile.java b/structr-ui/src/main/java/org/structr/web/entity/AbstractFile.java
